        "id": 120702,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-16T13:24:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The statement has always been to do everything you can do. The destroy in the first sentence isn't a cost / trigger (as it is in the second), so a villain card can be discarded instead of played and nothing else happens.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
